	measure 'Variance Units % Display' = ```
			
			VAR VarPct = DIVIDE ( [Actual Units] - [AOP Units], [AOP Units], 0 )
			VAR Arrow = 
			    SWITCH ( 
			        TRUE(),
			        VarPct > 0, UNICHAR ( 8593 ),   -- ↑ Up arrow
			        VarPct < 0, UNICHAR ( 8595 ),   -- ↓ Down arrow
			        ""
			    )
			VAR Sign = IF ( VarPct >= 0, "+", "" )
			RETURN
			    Arrow & " " & Sign & FORMAT ( VarPct, "0.0%" ) & " vs AOP"
			```
		lineageTag: 4b0e9e56-a3d9-443a-8c1b-4571d1cb6ada

